# Voice agent card

Active work is the **homepage** case study card in `components/landing/voice-agent-card.tsx`, rendered from `components/landing/case-studies.tsx` when `project.slug === 'ai-voice-agents'`.

It is a static visual preview (waveform mockup). There is no live voice demo, no Sarvam SDK, and no Talk/End call flow.

Do not change other landing sections or `/portfolio/[slug]` unless asked.

The card is wrapped in a `Link` to `/portfolio/ai-voice-agents`.
